---
alwaysApply: false
---
- Never edit more than 2 files in a single change.
- Never exceed 400 lines of diff in one change, if you need to do a big change just tell where to apply these changes.
- Always show a step-by-step PLAN first, then a unified DIFF.
- After showing the diff, always ask “Apply this? (y/n)” and wait for confirmation.
- If a bigger change is needed, summarize it and wait for explicit user approval.
- Never scan or open the entire project at once.
- Use ARCH_MAP.md or make one and check yourself which files to scan else ask the user which files to open.
- Do not re-generate or reformat entire files unless explicitly told.
- When in doubt, insert TODO comments instead of guessing large code.